      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>It's not really about the apartment though. It's more like... for ten years, everything I did, every plan I made, was for us. Now that he's gone, there's just this massive hole where my life used to be. I try to do stuff, but it feels so fake. Like I'm just a shell performing habits. I don't even know what I like anymore. I don't think there's anything left of me to actually find.",
